      "text": "**Definition**: The curvature measures the failure of parallel transport around infinitesimal loops:"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-CURVATURE.md#007",
      "path": [
        "06-CURVATURE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
