        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Curvature",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n  R(X,Y)Z = nabla_X nabla_Y Z - nabla_Y nabla_X Z - nabla_{[X,Y]} Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-CURVATURE.md#008",
      "path": [
        "06-CURVATURE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
