        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Curvature",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "This is a (1,3) tensor: R: TM x TM x TM -> TM\n  Antisymmetric in X,Y.\n  R(X,Y)Z = -R(Y,X)Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-CURVATURE.md#009",
