        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Curvature",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "In coordinates (components of (0,4) tensor R_{lijk} = g(R(partial_k, partial_j) partial_l, partial_i)):\n  R^l_{kij} = partial_i Gamma^l_{kj} - partial_j Gamma^l_{ki} + Gamma^l_{im} Gamma^m_{kj} - Gamma^l_{jm} Gamma^m_{ki}"
